# Concise UI + Motion

When restyling any remaining SnagDesk page or feature to match the dashboard concise UI, **always ship motion in the same pass** — do not leave animations for a follow-up.

## Concise UI baseline
- Wrapper: `motion.div` + `useMotionSafe().fadeUp`, `space-y-3 pb-4`
- Header: `font-display text-lg font-bold md:text-xl`, subtitle `text-[11px] text-ink-400`
- Compact CTAs: `Button size="sm"` with `!min-h-[36px] !px-2.5 text-xs` where dense
- Tokens: `ink-*` / `brand-*` / `surface` (no `slate-*` / old `primary` leftovers)
- Prefer `StatCard`, compact `Card` rows, overflow menus over heavy dual-action bars
- Responsive: dense on mobile, usable grids on `md+`

## Required motion (use `useMotionSafe`)
- Page enter: `fadeUp`
- Lists / grids: stagger children via `stagger(i)` (cap delay ~12 items)
- Filter / tab / category switches: `AnimatePresence mode="wait"` crossfade or short slide
- Interactive pills / segmented controls: `layoutId` spring (Tabs / SegmentedControl pattern)
- Progress bars that change with state: animate width with motion when practical
- Respect `reduced` — skip or zero-duration motion when `useReducedMotion` is set
- Timing: ~0.28–0.42s ease `[0.22, 1, 0.36, 1]` or soft springs (stiffness ~160–400, damping ~26–32)

## Reference screens
Match patterns already used in: AdminDashboard, ProjectsList, ProjectDetail, MyFlats, FlatDetail, FillChecklist.
